#: ../../source/docs/learning-mode.rst:5 49a7682cb0a54473934a10d1935c0311
msgid "Learning Mode (deprecated)"
msgstr "学习模式（已弃用）"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-mode.rst:7 0946820ffb064642bae866ade5b270cc
msgid ""
"In Rover-3.2 (and higher) Learning mode has been removed and replaced by the"
" \"Save Waypoint\" :ref:`auxiliary switch function <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Rover-3.2（及更高版本）中，学习模式已被移除，替换为「保存航点」:ref:`辅助开关功能 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-mode.rst:9 bd37570c5b3f4d2aa9b9bc134f7c7555
msgid ""
"In Rover-3.1 and earlier, Learning drove exactly like :ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>` and waypoints would be saved in the mission command list when the "
"channel 7 switch was momentarily toggled."
msgstr ""
"在 Rover-3.1 及更早版本中，学习模式的驾驶方式与 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 完全相同，当通道 7 "
"开关瞬间拨动时，航点将保存到任务命令列表中。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-mode.rst:11 20970965c75442bdb9f8b26e12b07544
msgid ""
"There is more information on this mode in the topic :ref:`Learning a Mission"
" <common-learning-a-mission>`."
msgstr "有关此模式的更多信息，请参见主题 :ref:`学习任务 <common-learning-a-mission>`。"
